te-releases">GitHub Copilot Changelog</source></item><item><title>GitHub Copilot for JetBrains 迎来 Ignite 更新</title><link>https://github.blog/changelog/2026-11-17-github-copilot-in-jetbrains-ignite-releases</link><description>JetBrains 版 GitHub Copilot 新增远程访问、本地语音输入与浏览器使用控制，还补了上下文用量快捷方式与历史差异查看。</description><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 18:00:59 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">16585d72ac903443120b9e0cd31ebffc48669ef9</guid><source url="https://github.blog/changelog/2026-11-17-github-copilot-in-jetbrains-ignite-releases">GitHub Copilot Changelog</source></item><item><title>Copilot 活动可接入 Microsoft Agent 365 监控</title><link>https://github.blog/changelog/2026-11-17-monitor-github-copilot-activity-through-microsoft-agent-365</link><description>企业现可把 GitHub Copilot 的智能体活动流式传输到 Microsoft Agent 365，在微软的智能体管控平面里统一审计。</description><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 18:00:59 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">f7d1e15580c30d5475426e0b5c9e181d61e9bef0</guid><source url="https://github.blog/changelog/2026-11-17-monitor-github-copilot-activity-through-microsoft-agent-365">GitHub Copilot Changelog</source></item><item><title>GitHub Copilot Evals 开放公开预览</title><link>https://github.blog/changelog/2026-11-17-github-copilot-evals-is-now-in-public-preview</link><description>GitHub Copilot Evals 开放公开预览，帮你根据提示词、模型与技能的变化持续调优 Copilot 的实际表现。</description><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 18:00:33 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">2b90807377a92d888efb0c2284fe1d56f6fdbdc3</guid><source url="https://github.blog/changelog/2026-11-17-github-copilot-evals-is-now-in-public-preview">GitHub Copilot Changelog</source></item><item><title>Claude Code 2.1.327 发布</title><link>https://code.claude.com/docs/en/changelog#2-1-327</link><description>Claude Code 2.1.327 在安装 GitHub 应用改动仓库前先征求确认，并让 MCP 服务器配置可从标准输入读取 JSON。</description><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 23:22:59 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">2b7a7366c72677641c0dd7f4007e9797114b8bbe</guid><source url="https://code.claude.com/docs/en/changelog#2-1-327">Claude Code Changelog</source></item><item><title>Qwen Code TypeScript SDK v0.1.35</title><link>https://github.com/QwenLM/qwen-code/releases/tag/sdk-typescript-v0.1.35</link><description>Qwen Code 的 TypeScript 软件包更新到 0.1.35，捆绑的命令行版本同步到 0.28.0。</description><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 12:07:45 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">55d604a6c28c10311e2a998c268322e38b117af0</guid><source url="https://github.com/QwenLM/qwen-code/releases/tag/sdk-typescript-v0.1.35">Qwen Code Releases</source></item><item><title>Qwen Code v0.27.4 每日构建版（11 月 16 日）</title><link>https://github.com/QwenLM/qwen-code/releases/tag/v0.27.4-nightly.20261116.eb3a599ef3</link><description>Qwen Code 的每日构建版，包含网页端工作区筛选和托管智能体的钉钉适配等最新改动。</description><pubDate>Mon, 16 Nov 2026 23:24:42 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">33a4d7ce33a6d15e274f5667bf1453f327e4a275</guid><source url="https://github.com/QwenLM/qwen-code/releases/tag/v0.27.4-nightly.20261116.eb3a599ef3">Qwen Code Releases</source></item><item><title>从一百万次评测里学到的经验</title><link>https://kiro.dev/blog/1m-evals-lessons</link><description>Kiro 团队复盘了一百万次评测，指出固定题库加二元通过率的评测方式容易失真，并分享了更靠谱的做法。</description><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 20:30:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">ec14445f64bf30917f80b0bde0881a0c97f851cb</guid><source url="https://kiro.dev/blog/1m-evals-lessons">Kiro Blog</source></item><item><title>构建主动式智能体的经验谈</title><link>https://www.langchain.com/blog/what-weve-learned-building-proactive-agents</link><description>LangChain 复盘 GTM Agent 与 Robin 的开发经验：主动式智能体自行推进目标、只在需要时向人确认，记忆与交互体验是成败关键。</description><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 16:49:24 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">226d5fe68e915d58be26db8ab0d2dab1b59e0d7c</guid><source url="https://www.langchain.com/blog/what-weve-learned-building-proactive-agents">LangChain Blog</source></item><item><title>LangSmith 新增追踪数据敏感信息保护控制</title><link>https://www.langchain.com/blog/protect-sensitive-data-in-your-traces-new-controls-in-langsmith</link><description>LangSmith 上线新的访问控制，帮助团队管好追踪数据里的敏感信息，让不同成员只能看到自己权限范围内的内容。</description><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 18:00:02 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">207b91be1156ef2eb2a3d3652a8381b63b4fdeb4</guid><source url="https://www.langchain.com/blog/protect-sensitive-data-in-your-traces-new-controls-in-langsmith">LangChain Blog</source></item><item><title>Copilot 代码评审：自适应力度与密钥检测</title><link>https://github.blog/changelog/2026-11-17-copilot-code-review-adaptive-effort-secret-detection-and-more</link><description>GitHub Copilot 代码评审新增自适应力度，按拉取请求的复杂程度调整评审深度，并加强了密钥泄露检测。</description><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 18:02:05 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">d463ce80860760b92525c154a5e2fde979fbbeb9</guid><source url="https://github.blog/changelog/2026-11-17-copilot-code-review-adaptive-effort-secret-detection-and-more">GitHub Copilot Changelog</source></item><item><title>MAI Code 2 与 MAI Code 2 Flash 接入 GitHub Copilot</title><link>https://github.blog/changelog/2026-11-17-mai-code-2-and-mai-code-2-flash-in-github-copilot</link><description>微软新一代 AI 编程模型 MAI Code 2 与轻量版 MAI Code 2 Flash 已接入 GitHub Copilot。</description><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 18:01:45 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">1fae7e83ee21808fafd0ae199ecaae864baf0ce6</guid><source url="https://github.blog/changelog/2026-11-17-mai-code-2-and-mai-code-2-flash-in-github-copilot">GitHub Copilot Changelog</source></item><item><title>GitHub Copilot CLI 支持 Microsoft Entra 登录预览</title><link>https://github.blog/changelog/2026-11-17-github-copilot-cli-adds-microsoft-entra-sign-in-as-a-preview</link><description>GitHub Copilot 命令行现已支持 Microsoft Entra 账号登录预览，可静默认证到关联的 GitHub Enterprise 托管用户。</description><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 18:00:35 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">2217122441a2dd3767514458a43053f3da238975</guid><source url="https://github.blog/changelog/2026-11-17-github-copilot-cli-adds-microsoft-entra-sign-in-as-a-preview">GitHub Copilot Changelog</source></item></channel></rss>
